# Uniface XML exports are byte-faithful serializations of repository objects.
# Git must be a faithful COURIER, never a transformer: do NOT convert line
# endings (CRLF<->LF) or otherwise rewrite these files across platforms
# (Windows IDE  <->  Unix/Linux deploy target). EOL/encoding drift across
# platform moves is a classic cause of Uniface import/export breakage and
# all-lines-changed diff noise. `-text` disables EOL normalization while
# keeping textual diffs, and preserves exact bytes incl. any UTF-8 BOM.
# See worklog/020 and .claude/rules/uniface-export-staging.md.

workarea/**/*.xml   -text
components/**/*.xml  -text
src/**/*.xml         -text

# Repository round-trip artifacts elsewhere, if added later, should follow suit.
